						 <p>My collab-con piece, written by myself and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/avelon21" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5341612&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561393159" alt="Avelon21" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5341612)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/avelon21" >Avelon21</a></span>! This is my first post on the site proper, after a few WL pieces, and I'm quite nervous about how I did, so please give your thoughts below.</p> <p>Big thanks to:<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561393159" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" >The Great Hippo</a></span> for helping me integrate the AWCY? document into the MC&amp;D format<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kindlyturtleclem" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4504036&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561393159" alt="KindlyTurtleClem" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4504036)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kindlyturtleclem" >KindlyTurtleClem</a></span> for critique<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1561393159" alt="FloppyPhoenix" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/floppyphoenix" >FloppyPhoenix</a></span> for help with tagging and how to add people here<br /> A big thanks to the S